            "review_text": "rimpi k\n2 contributions\n0\nBartender Nguyen exceptional service\nAug 2026 • Family\nBartender Nguyen was very professional and helpful. He remembered our order and always greeted us with a smile.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 12, 2026\nQuest46014431033\nDear 407rimpik,\n\nThank you so much for sharing your wonderful feedback! We are delighted to hear that you had such a pleasant experience with Bartender Nguyen. It is wonderful to know that his professionalism, attentiveness, and warm smile made your visits even more enjoyable. We will certainly share your kind words with Nguyen, as we are sure they will mean a lot to him.\n\nWe truly appreciate your recognition and look forward to welcoming you back for another memorable experience soon!\n\nWarm regards,\nUnspoken Bar Team\nRead more\nWritten August 17, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
